  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Exclude the architecture-dependent NaN sign/payload bytes from fixed CPython vectors while retaining exact byte assertions for every finite and infinite value, exact raw round trips including NaN, byteswap round trips, and explicit math.isnan semantics. The focused test passes on Linux x64 and native Linux arm64 at ff05b2b7.",
